meta {
  name: Admin RSVP — delete event (final cleanup)
  type: http
  seq: 45
}

delete {
  url: {{host}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{organizerToken}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 204
}

docs {
  Cleanup so the full-collection run (auth users templates events event-payloads wedding
  invitation-config guest-groups guests admin-rsvp) is rerunnable. Moved here (out of
  events/) because every folder from event-payloads/ through admin-rsvp/ shares the same
  {{eventId}} captured by events/00-create.bru — deleting the event at the end of events/
  itself (before those folders run) made every downstream folder 404. This must stay the
  LAST request in the whole top-level chain (admin-rsvp/ is last per folder.bru seq
  ordering, and this file has the highest seq within it).
}
